        "filing_date": "2026-02-19",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "We provide professional development programs—including career skills training, peer mentoring, and opportunities to engage with senior leaders—along with structured leadership development programs, associate and community engagement teams, impact networks, and other learning and development programs to support team member development, engagement, and job satisfaction.",
